  "steps": [
    "To a blender add 400g Greek yogurt, 20g almonds, 20g pistachios, 12 strands saffron, soaked in 120ml milk, 60g seedless dates, 1/2 tsp cardamom powder, 1 scoop vanilla protein powder, A pinch of salt, Blend until smooth.",
    "Pour it evenly into 3 containers.",
    "Now add around 20g chia seeds to each container, Mix well.",
    "Refrigerate for at least 2 hours or until completely set.",
    "Once it’s out of the fridge, top it with any fruits or berries of your choice. I used strawberries.",
    "And it’s ready to serve!"
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Use about 20 g chia seeds per container (60 g in total). Top with fruit of your choice.",
